>
>pe'a lo piro ninmu cu xrula po'a

That should be {ro ninmu cu xrula}. {piro} means "the whole",
{ro} is "all". Also, {ro ninmu} = {ro lo ninmu}.

{lo ro ninmu} is "at least one of all those that are women".

